{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407810/extras/TradGirl_Wishlist.png?t=1743023567\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2>Leon is a young man stuck in a world of temptations. Parties, fleeting affairs, and fleeting pleasures seem like sources of happiness to him, but beneath this bright facade lies only emptiness.<br><br>One day he meets Agnes, a girl whose innocence and kindness enchant him. Her view of the world, her beliefs, which seem so naive and pure, make him reflect on his own.<br><br>Will he be able to leave his old life behind and start a new chapter with Agnes? Or will everything remain the same?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Captivating story<br></li><li>Vivid illustrations<br></li><li>Interactive dialogues<br></li><li>Comfy music</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407810?t=1743023567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407810/f1d3a29098c244b621372de545b0c1cfc0eb7acf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743023567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407810/549e23325c50673ce5b106e5b15f452b7555730e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743023567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407810/549e23325c50673ce5b106e5b15f452b7555730e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743023567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains mature content, including sexual themes, flirting, suggestive scenes, innuendos, mild profanity and alcohol use."},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407810/extras/TradGirl_Wishlist.png?t=1743023567\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2>Leon is a young man stuck in a world of temptation